Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我现在真的很需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I could really use your help down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要抓到Abaddon了 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting close, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不能放弃这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't drop the ball on Abaddon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把该隐之印给你 如果这是你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you the mark Dean if it's what you truly want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要知道 随之而来的负担非常沉重\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to know with the mark comes a great burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想从我这儿得到什么 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want of me Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,重建天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebuild Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做我的副手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna be my second-in-command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,先证明你已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel 我们在撰写自己的史诗故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel, we are writting our own epic story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿回了我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have my grace back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切来讲 不是我的 但是效果差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not mine, per se, but, it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使的内部争斗该结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels fighting angels has to stop somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向我证明了 还有另一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You showed me that there is a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会追随你 而我不会是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will follow you and I'm not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:45.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邪恶力量 作者Carver Edlund 超自然圣诞节）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让一个故事留存于世\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes a story work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是剧情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it the plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是角色 是遣词造句\N{\fnArial\fs30}The characters, the text.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.39,0:01:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是潜台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}The subtext.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是谁赋予了故事重大意义 是作者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who gives the story meaning, is it the writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我给你讲一个小故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight I thought I would tell you a little story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让你自己抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 Carlos\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Carlos.Listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦发现任何恶魔活动的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you catch wind bit more demon activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻打给我好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a holler, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有进展吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几起恶魔相关案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dozen demon related cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,被剥夺了灵魂的人活动频繁\N{\fnArial\fs30}People without souls acting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 没有Abaddon的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But - But no sign of Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 她就像是消失了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, like she's vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就必须继续调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we just have to keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续工作 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get to work - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 求你别伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please don't, don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hannah\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hannah 这里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah, what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你的声音了 到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard your tune.What was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那声音很耳熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来就像是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounded like heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一切都很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so strange down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.01,0:04:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我循着那声音来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed the tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了很多兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And found so many of my brothers and sisters as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为会是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可突然门就关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the door slammed shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那个奇怪的天使出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a strange angel arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他听命于新的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he worked for the new god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听命于Metatron吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我们提出了条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made us an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,效忠Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,归顺的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those that did would one day be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以回归天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allowed to return to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回归天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他说他能带我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he said he would take us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些天使动摇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some angels joined him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的朋友们拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends and I refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们所有人感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all our loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你公开和Bartholomew作对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took stand against Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,会领导我们一起对付Metatron吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead us against Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 我不是当领袖的人 Hannah\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But - I am no leader, Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我会找到Metatron的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will find Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离我越远 就越安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safer away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 那个攻击你的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this angel who attacked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel吗 Gadreel成了Metatron的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel?Gadreel is working for Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说Metatron让Gadreel杀了Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Metatron made Gadreel kill Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it would explain a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且从那之后就没有先知了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, there have been no new prophets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.27,0:06:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron能充分利用自己的长处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which Metatron could've fixed to his advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Gadreel said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些天使要怎么回天堂去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the angels returning the heavan how.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为那个咒语是不可逆转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the spell was irreversible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是Crowley那么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Crowley said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着我们去找Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's just find Gadreel and.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:06:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,严刑拷问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat some answers out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's something to start with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.89,0:07:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我正在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你发一张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending you a photo of the symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的符号召集了很多天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}That drew all the angels in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西像是一个天使报警器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's acting as…some kind of angel siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该是个符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来激活咒语的材料很罕见\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ingredients used to creat it were very odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮鹫的羽毛 精灵的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin feathers, bonds of a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've never seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们找找看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let me see what we can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:29.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（荣誉栏）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车旅馆里的军用酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's honorable about a miniature bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里光荣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the motel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里都光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.24,0:07:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺好的 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine Cass, how about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念我的翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭不可闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I got match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是任何神话传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not from the lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是警方记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from police records.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:07:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个符咒这几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like that symbol you found was spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:07:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,频繁出现在凶杀案现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a handful of crime scenes the last couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是多重凶杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}All multiple homicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪现场都在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where were these crime scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹他州的 贝克镇 谷峰镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utah, Baker, Hill Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在犹他州的西隆镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm in Bishop's Falls, Utah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且好像大部分犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also looks like most crime scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在工业区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were in industrial areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来Gadreel在往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Gadreel was heading north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个大镇是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's next big town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是奥本 或者奥格登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be Auburn or Ogden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去奥本 我们去奥格登\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right you take the Auburn we take Ogden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是在奥格登办过案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we work a case in Ogden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是个女巫事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It…it was a witch situation, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上有个小伙帮过我们对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was a kid in town that helped us, wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们应该给他打电话 看他是不是还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we should call him, see if he's still in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what was his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是下午了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能在你这儿买点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if I may procure from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮鹫的羽毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feathers of griffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是有些私下出售的物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…we got some off the menu items.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这儿不是对角巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this ain't Diagon Alley, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到门上的标识了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the Hunter signs on the door, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这儿有我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have what I seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮鹫的羽毛是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin feathers, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是想拿着去酒吧泡妞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly looking to trip the light fantastic, are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类总是惊喜不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans never cease to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是还有精灵的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you also have fairy bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,出生的地域并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does not matter what realm they were from.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮鹫和精灵 你到底是想抓什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffins and faries, the hell you're hunting, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看能找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的时候你需要从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometime you need a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,急匆匆的城市生活中喘一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}From hustle and bustle of city life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hash tag Am I Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的时候你只是需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometime you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,色情古堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hash tag CasaErotica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,色情古堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casa Erotica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不正经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me, bucko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gabriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就当你记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.25,0:11:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,半仙不耍戏法还叫半仙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take the trick out of the trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你一手制造了你的假死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I assume you faked your own death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 我不在的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume you weren't letting to Mensa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把上面搅乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.31,0:11:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你懂我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿跑跑 那儿转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hither with a side of yon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直躲着 冷面队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hiding, captain side eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在世界上最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the safest place in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没过多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和那两个傻帽就非得要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other two stooges just had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,搅得天下大乱 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ruin Christmas now, didn't ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh cry me a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我退出了 我隐居了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I dropped, I hid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于看了唐顿庄园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally watched Downton Abbey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你的好闺蜜Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, your BFF Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出他的狗腿手下成天找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent his minions out looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 他觉得既然我是一个大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently he thinks since I'm an Archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我肯定还没死透\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I have extra juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你是个威胁 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That you're a threat - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也在堕天时受了伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got hurt in the fall, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤进那个色情片几乎耗尽了我所有荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used most of my juice to get back in a porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是说漏嘴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…came out wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一句也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh the point is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.75,0:12:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在逃路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 几周之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被召唤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody started playing my song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列之角\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Horn of Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爹手里的小宝贝之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of dad's little party favours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都没怎么玩儿过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I have never got around to messing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron发现了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron dug it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后吹响了号角\N{\fnArial\fs30}And started blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定重新现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然天使们人多势众\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're safety in numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Metatron用号角抓捕天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Metatron's using it to trap angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是集结他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unite them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是Metatron干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的副手Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was his second-in-command, Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That old chestnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your help, Columbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要建立新的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting the band back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后追着Metatron猛打\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going on the kill Metatron tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在你面前的是一线队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're looking at the new front man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有一盒子羽毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got an open box of feathers over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在Gadreel发出指令前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he lights up the bad signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是Dean另外 另外一个号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dean's other, other cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So must know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开着车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands free much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把爪子放方向盘上 我可是贵重货物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put those on the wheel, I'm precious cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 最近怎么样啊 小矮子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's up, shorties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你们的罪孽英勇牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy who died for your sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是满脸胡子穿着凉鞋的大叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the guy with the beard in the sandals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是更帅的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hot one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你们给我送花还替我哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for the flowers and condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我的家人是很大的慰藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really meant a lot to the fam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any old how.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正跟你们的小男宠在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy toy and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在去秘密基地的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are rolling our way towards our top secret domicile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个小毛孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those gooky kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你已经回来好几个月了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've been back for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都看见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you seen out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是满天掉长翅膀的怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After it was raining winged men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:15:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天堂混乱局面后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.Total nigh biblical chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crolwey\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon小蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Aba-duch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得不可开交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duking it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺有看点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's our buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,像纸屑一样分崩离析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scattered like confetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一阵子所有人都很不适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been a lot of confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数天使跟我们不一样 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most angels aren't like us, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没法接受自由意志这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't handle this whole…free will thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像羊群\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是反叛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个初出茅庐 一个已经有了一番事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}One without a cause, one with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别矫情了 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做上帝的时间比老爹都长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been God often than dad has.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那结果又如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how that worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.09,0:15:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你的好士兵去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a soldier all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要的士兵可是越多越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need as many as I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做 Gabriel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃离老爹 逃离家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}From dad, from the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要干我应该做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna do what I was meant to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你 我会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy it's gonna be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像需要加点儿油了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little low on gas, aren't we.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到致癌物质的气息了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell that cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是美味啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我跟你提过的Metatron护卫队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the minions of Metatron I mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cas 还是我 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cas, it's Sam again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,回个电话 我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call us, we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这 狗东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能阻止他们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd never keep these guys out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 那又怎样 我们可以并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.So?We fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只有我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前是骗你的 我从来没有看过唐顿庄园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied before, I never watched Downtown Abbey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想融入社会而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to fit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我还剩下一些圣油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I do have some archangel juice left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以抵挡这帮蠢家伙足够长的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can hold these boneheads off long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough for what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙会把你砍成碎片的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys will cut you to ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可以他们拖住\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can stall them long enough for you to amscray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以接替我的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们需要一个领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels need a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:19:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got to be somebody like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,与众不同的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要要这个包袱Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't want this burden, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我又失败了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I fail again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.77,0:19:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.59,0:19:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间很紧哦 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't got all day, hot pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.63,0:19:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was any of these real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走啊 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们都得死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, we both die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.95,0:19:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪里露馅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gave it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的风衣之前撕坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My coat was torn earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最烦这种一出错就全露馅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hate continuity errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这些都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, none of these is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我现在也不在旅馆里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm guessing I'm no longer in the motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这些不是真实的 但是却是真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it was real, but all of it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的 还是Metatron的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours, or Metatron's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说完 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hear now, would you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 怎么帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?How.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的手稿我没全看完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't read the whole scripts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只看了有我的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just skimmed for my parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 很高兴见到你 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's good to see you, old bean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.87,0:20:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的故事才能留存于世\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes a story work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我觉得我是在看哈哈镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is like looking a fun house mirror for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.33,0:21:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直没法想象你是怎么看的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can not imagine how is it like for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从什么时候开始为Metatron卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been working for Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.21,0:21:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会开口的 你逼我也没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not talk, and you can not make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经附在你身上 Sam Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been you, Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你内心是如此愧疚和脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are inside reek of shame and weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Sam Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Sam, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来 门外说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我给你讲个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight I thought I'd tell you a little story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你来做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:21:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我原本的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my plan anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 这就是我计划的疏漏之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's where my story failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.12,0:22:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个有趣的小插曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the curious incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对啊 Granderye侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, Inspector Granderye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.39,0:22:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gregory探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sherlock Holmes知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:31.02,Title,0,0,0,0,,看白额闪电（出自《福尔摩斯探案集》）吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been here around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,进化成功的第一天就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since scaly things crawled out of the muck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去读读书 看看电影你会死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it kill you to pick up a book, watch a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会比较痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I know it's a bit of a redcon, but it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 这会让我们之间的谈话变得简单的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna make this whole conversation a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚把最近几个世纪我看过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gave you every book, movie and TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:22:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有书籍 电影和电视节目都共享给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have consumed in the last couple of millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.90,0:23:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是否明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界是由故事构成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe is made up of the stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是原子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not atoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.33,0:23:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句话出自Muriel Rukeyser的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}A quote by Muriel Rukeyser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,朽木可雕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.05,0:23:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几节课要上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here're a few more lessones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,写作俱乐部的第一原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}First rule of the writers' club.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.67,0:23:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天下文章一大抄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal from the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.55,0:23:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二条原则 每个英雄都需要一个大反派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second rule, every hero needs a villian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.54,0:23:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hannah 还有她的姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah, and her sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.38,0:23:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我捏造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set all that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀光所有不愿意听命于我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slaughter all those who are not join to my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let one live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.38,0:23:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.62,0:23:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他来讲述这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.63,0:23:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.60,0:23:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把天使们送回天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you bring angel back to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.82,0:23:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不能剧透\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, no spoilers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是搞错重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you keep missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该领导这些天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are supposed to lead the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是领袖 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a leader, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.81,0:24:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我做了做功课\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I did my homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Winchester福音书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchester Gospels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.10,0:24:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是纸质的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulpy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是给我了启发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me an idea though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.73,0:24:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要上一课\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be taught a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比Gabriel这老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody teaches lessones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,更适合了给人上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than good old Gabrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是半仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}AKA the trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.47,0:24:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我开始打字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I started typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.35,0:24:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.01,0:24:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了让我成为英雄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make me a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.71,0:24:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.62,0:25:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是这部作品里的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the hero in this mess-terpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是反派\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the villian.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.91,0:25:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.07,0:25:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会这么快就交代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna crack that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.78,0:25:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.95,0:25:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你入侵他的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could hack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.71,0:25:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像当初你和Crowley对我那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you and Crowley hacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.01,0:25:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只有Crowley才能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley is the only one can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.77,0:25:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这会儿没心情给那老不死的打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm in no mood to call that dickbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.09,0:25:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.05,0:25:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any word from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.08,0:25:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我试着找过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.I tried him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.15,0:25:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不接电话也不回短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't called, he hasn't texted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.19,0:25:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开了他手机上的GPS\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned on the GPS on his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.58,0:25:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在我们上次和他谈话的那个镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still in the same town we talked to him last.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.59,0:25:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.55,0:25:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你必须去找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, you gotta go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这件事太感情用事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too close to this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what, you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.05,0:25:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到他还没5分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not at this five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.43,0:25:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点儿就把他卸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going Liam Neeson on his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.01,0:26:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是他唱红脸 你唱白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he acts tough and you show kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.81,0:26:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.06,0:26:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我根本不在乎你是否会开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I don't care whether you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.09,0:26:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都会为你对他所做的事情付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta pay for what you did to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.98,0:26:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Kevin的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.23,0:26:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么我没有杀你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why I didn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.01,0:26:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我偷了你的荣光之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I stole you grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.43,0:26:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.43,0:26:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的那些小玩具里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among all God's little windup toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.35,0:26:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你还有几分勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the only one with any spunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.02,0:26:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将你变成人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left you human.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.95,0:26:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是希望你能在人间从此过上幸福的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was hoping you would live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.27,0:26:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你连那个也搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You screwed that up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.60,0:26:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.83,0:26:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.60,0:26:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说如果你想要重新加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean if you wanna get back on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.25,0:27:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 但是你必须跟着我的剧本走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, but you‘re gonna have to follow my script.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.42,0:27:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你之前的评价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on your assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.64,0:27:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我会做的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.80,0:27:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导那些愚蠢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead the dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.73,0:27:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,被剥夺权利的天使反抗我 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disenfranchised rebellious angel against me, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.95,0:27:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他们选择跟随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.03,0:27:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后就只有死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.66,0:27:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我会在上面给你留一个好位置的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna save a nice warm seat up top for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.76,0:27:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会被拯救的 - 想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will be saved - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要逼我下狠手 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna make me do the hard pitch, aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.27,0:27:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内偷来的荣光现在如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that stolen grace inside you working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.75,0:27:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.60,0:27:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 显然不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.21,0:27:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在燃烧 会把你化成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's burnning out, it's gonna burn you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.25,0:27:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可以给你无尽的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will give you an endless supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.89,0:27:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块可以反复充电的电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of rechargeable battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.97,0:28:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.21,0:28:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 抱歉打扰您的写作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt your writing session, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.93,0:28:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.43,0:28:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.61,0:28:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.04,0:28:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坊间流传\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words around the campfire is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.69,0:28:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把蛇放进了伊甸园\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let the snake into the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.72,0:28:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你让人类堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruined it for all the humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.51,0:28:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我给了他们自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set them free.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.51,0:28:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深爱人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.89,0:28:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你表达爱的方式可有点可笑 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you sure got a funny way of showing it, asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.17,0:28:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.51,0:28:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.87,0:28:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们回到天堂的所有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}About this getting back into the heaven crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.43,0:28:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你一个痛快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will end this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.72,0:28:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.66,0:28:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就坐在这跟这些铁链一起腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can sit there rot in those chains forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.07,0:28:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己选吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.88,0:28:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有你说的话 装腔作势\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your talk, all your bluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.53,0:28:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是无可匹敌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you are unvincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.15,0:28:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两人 对抗世界 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of you against the world, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.67,0:28:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的以为Sam会为了你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think Sam will do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.03,0:28:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I know he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.46,0:29:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经在你弟弟的身体里 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been in your brother's body, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.57,0:29:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会拿他的命来换回你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not trade his life for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.84,0:29:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢提醒啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for the rerun, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.20,0:29:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam已经跟我说过这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's already told me all that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.33,0:29:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他说的还要更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he has told me worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.04,0:29:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉你他一直是这样想的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told you that he has always felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.03,0:29:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得你只是个胆小怕事的小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are just a scared little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.58,0:29:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕自己一个人被留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is afraid to be on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.08,0:29:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你从来得不到父亲足够的爱护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because daddy never loves him enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.91,0:29:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is right, isn't he.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.97,0:29:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right to think you are a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.33,0:29:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个软弱无能的 索求无度\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sad, clingy, needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.23,0:29:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.03,0:29:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可悲的 卑微的底层生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic, bottom feeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.31,0:29:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,连自己都照顾不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can not even take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.77,0:29:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,宁愿拉上所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would rather drag everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.44,0:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不愿自己一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the mud than be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.01,0:29:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有他身边的人都得替他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would let everyone around him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.55,0:29:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 下手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.60,0:30:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,下手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.99,0:30:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.50,0:30:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的就是这个效果 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'd like that, wouldn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才故意激怒我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what all that speech was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.43,0:30:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怕死 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not afraid to die, are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.13,0:30:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕的是我把你一直锁在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid to be left on these chains forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.03,0:30:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在这儿等死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could sit here and rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.78,0:30:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.94,0:31:51.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来自Dean的6个未接来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.59,0:31:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 小老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.12,0:31:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来做交易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.97,0:32:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手里有我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.89,0:32:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手里有你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have something of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.61,0:32:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上带他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,6点左右吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say…six-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.89,0:32:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不来 Castiel就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, Castiel dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.49,0:32:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次他可没法复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No come-backs this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.61,0:32:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会临时变卦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}An even trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.03,0:32:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向说话算话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an entity of my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.20,0:32:46.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（Sam来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.18,0:33:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.69,0:33:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.27,0:33:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.92,0:33:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.58,0:33:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 下次换个问题问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got to stop asking me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.72,0:33:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在给你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.44,0:33:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么不 - 他什么都不肯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you - He won't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.98,0:33:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我后来发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.67,0:33:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.11,0:33:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来打算杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was gonna kill him.I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.99,0:33:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没有 因为我知道他活着还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I stopped 'cause I know we need him to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.66,0:33:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.69,0:33:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron抓走了Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron has Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.82,0:33:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想跟我们交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's offering us a trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.48,0:33:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候能相信Metatron了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't trust Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.80,0:33:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.11,0:33:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 这是我们第一次有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is the first time we're gonna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.99,0:33:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道Metatron到底是何方神圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}For sure what Metatron is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.28,0:33:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就把Gadreel带去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take Gadreel to the meet-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.80,0:33:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了交换之后 困住Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the exchange, and then trap Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.52,0:34:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.13,0:34:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者根本不打算来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he's not gonna show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.91,0:34:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'm gonna show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.28,0:34:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在等你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just waiting for you two to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.66,0:34:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的陷阱弄好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finished setting up your little trap for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.39,0:34:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站的地方对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I hitting my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.67,0:34:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 赶紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.72,0:34:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还愣着干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.53,0:35:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们谁还有多余的料吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either of you brings s'mores.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.02,0:35:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣火总是有一股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fire always gives them a.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.74,0:35:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,温愠的薄荷味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delightful minty after taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.22,0:35:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,许个愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a wish, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.32,0:35:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.52,0:35:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.47,0:35:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易还是要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a deal is a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.62,0:35:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.89,0:35:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我有这个能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.95,0:35:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you, and your little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.49,0:35:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天使朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your fine feathered friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.87,0:35:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你藏在基地里的那些小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the secrets you got locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.97,0:36:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没法阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your bunker can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.81,0:36:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会享受看你们挣扎的过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am gonna enjoy watching you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.75,0:36:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对会是一出好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be hell of a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.00,0:36:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you around, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.27,0:36:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我给过你机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never forget I gave you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.40,0:36:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody wanna tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.18,0:36:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在到底什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.63,0:36:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron想当上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron is trying to play God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.44,0:36:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,想当上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.75,0:36:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 他轻松抹掉了天使驱逐符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, he erased angel warding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.62,0:36:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 他还吹灭了圣火\N{\fnArial\fs30}He freaking…blew the holy fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.28,0:36:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.27,0:36:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在用天使预言石的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's powering up with the angel tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.23,0:36:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么可能阻止得了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we supposed to stop this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.29,0:36:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果真的有办法回归天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what if there is a stairway to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.81,0:36:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就去那儿守株待兔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find it and get a drop on the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.94,0:36:49.63,Title,0,0,0,0,,你是想一路潜行到死星（《银河帝国》中的军事要塞）\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to sneak onto the Death Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.63,0:36:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一举拿下人家帝王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take out the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.66,0:36:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.26,0:36:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的科幻太空要塞跟现在有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a fictional battle station in space has to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.79,0:36:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果拿下帝王\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if taking out the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.49,0:36:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等于除去Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means taking out the Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我愿意加入 - 等等 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm on board - Wait, did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚听懂了我们说的梗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just understand the Death Star reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.82,0:37:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.06,0:37:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand what.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.42,0:37:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些跟天堂有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has to do with heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.02,0:37:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's halfway I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.28,0:37:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.12,0:37:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.30,0:37:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.73,0:37:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一些不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something different about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.03,0:37:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.28,0:37:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想终结一切 - 该死的 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This means to an end - Damnit, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.90,0:37:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到天堂入口了 告诉我们一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you find heaven you drop a dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.46,0:37:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有个地狱骑士要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meantime, I got a knight to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.57,0:37:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be safe out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.66,0:37:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.05,0:37:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.24,0:37:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.05,0:38:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那扇门安全了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the door secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.19,0:38:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家的路很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way home is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.01,0:38:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.05,0:38:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的剧写得怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did your play turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.05,0:38:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟以前设想的 稍微有些出入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't quite turn out as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.64,0:38:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才删稿重写\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is why we re-write.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.00,0:38:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是上帝惹的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was God's problem, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.88,0:38:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,发了第一稿之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You published the first draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.79,0:38:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.44,0:38:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不停的修改 让你想要的故事进行下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep editting to get all your ducks in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.90,0:38:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟抓住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the Winchesteres grabbing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.95,0:38:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在计划之内吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.49,0:38:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个意外的惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.60,0:39:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来 哪个作家不喜欢剧情转折呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, what a writer doesn't love a good twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.29,0:39:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.95,0:39:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是建立好生动的人物形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is to set up interesting characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.08,0:39:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们会带给我怎样的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see where they lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.72,0:39:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,随之而来的副产品 是这些丰满的人物形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The by-product of having well-drawn characters is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.43,0:39:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候会给你带来惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.60,0:39:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道他们不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know something they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.29,0:39:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.47,0:39:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局怎么走 不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I get there, doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.34,0:39:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是每个角色各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as everybody plays their part.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.70,0:40:26.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你注定是领导者）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.25,0:40:55.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（Castiel走出去加入了他的追随者）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.54,0:41:37.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上帝在云端看着他们 对自己的作品表示满意）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.34,0:41:41.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未完待续）
